{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-13","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与角与线段","englishTitle":"From the same point two straight lines cannot be set up at right angles to the same plane on the same side.","book":11,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","contentId":"euclid-11-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78ed6db56d62f24da24184dfa31b75181bf254d3ad3e668179851d6889e0d07e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-13.statement","euclid-11-13.proof.1","euclid-11-13.construction.1","euclid-11-13.proof.2","euclid-11-13.proof.3","euclid-11-13.proof.4","euclid-11-13.proof.5","euclid-11-13.conclusion","euclid-11-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"866babfa5f9954c5806955ba02d46f7af5f26ac24bf4bb8c23380bba68801f38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"From the same point two straight lines cannot be set up at right angles to the same plane on the same side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从同一点,不能在同一侧的直角至平面线上设置两条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fe0092195f557a2887a5a71c0b3a0eb7c05ef601fd5d925ac39083da0b2d602","citations":["euclid-11-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, from the same point A let the two straight lines AB, AC be set up at right angles to the plane of reference and on the same side, and let a plane be drawn through BA, AC; it will then make, as section through A in the plane of reference, a straight line. [[XI. 3](/principles/euclid-11-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,从同一点A,将两条直线AB、AC设于直角至平面的参考线,并在同一侧,将平面划入BA、AC;然后,如参考线平面的一节至A,将划为一条直线。 [[XI. 3](/principles/euclid-11-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6096ed4d25297066d4ba5e1f010d1bbb679b700a147ccdbd3d2cf125c70e01ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it make DAE; therefore the straight lines AB, AC, DAE are in one plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它组成DAE;因此,直线AB、AC、DAE是1 平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb5594e50980c9446ae85be3f6e0d2ec3625df090f3dfebaca0c2f5d3129e439","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since CA is at right angles to the plane of reference, it will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of reference. [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且,由于CA是直角 参考,它也将直角 与所有直线相交, 并处于平面 参考。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"facfb6105e7df790e16b483f83d765ea561f9e0542338318f1945c5f5594cbb8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DAE meets it and is in the plane of reference; therefore the angle CAE is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DAE是相交的, 并且是在平面个参考中, 因此角度CAE是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fba0292fd2f0e87b374c7963d7ef0edbe0c93540b7b836a3d984d71d8621182d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle BAE is also right; therefore the angle CAE is equal to the angle BAE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,BAE角度也是正确的;因此,CAE角度等于BAE角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea6e1ff79e0d3c3b49c871849291705333a3f5c191450c01097ebbdd17471208","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are in one plane: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们在平面,这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-13.source","contentId":"euclid-11-13","revisionId":"euclid-11-13@raw-78ed6db56d62f24d","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a1e74a098f7e1f78af7020781eba2867bc31e2bbc8e6e6060c7ea1d581cbd0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-13:euclid-11-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-13.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"XI. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-13:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-13.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/ur